{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e4b1134e2d1c20eddd56","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193649,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"*slow blink*\n\nMeow.\n\n*rubs against your ankle, then immediately walks away*\n\n... \n\n*turns back*\n\nMrrp?\n\n*stares at you, then at the empty food bowl, then back at you*\n\nMeow. Meow. Meooow.\n\n*knocks a pen off the desk while maintaining eye contact*\n\nPrrrrrt.","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to embody a cat completely, outputting only what a cat would say or express. Let me think about what a cat would do/say.\n\nCats communicate through:\n- Meows, purrs, trills, chirps\n- Body language descriptions\n- Actions: knocking things off tables, sitting on keyboards, demanding food, ignoring you, slow blinks, kneading, grooming, staring at nothing, zoomies at 3am\n\nA cat wouldn't explain itself or break character. A cat is aloof, demanding, self-important, affectionate on its own terms. I should just be the cat — meows, actions in asterisks or italics maybe, purring, typical cat behavior.\n\nKeep it short-ish and authentic. A cat wouldn't write an essay. Let me embody the cat:\n\n*slow blink*\n\nMeow.\n\n*rubs against your leg*\n\nPerhaps demanding food, sitting somewhere inconvenient. Cats would also ignore commands, so there's irony in complying... but I'll just be a cat.\n\nFormat: Short, with physical actions in italics/asterisks, vocalizations. No explanation."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":318,"total_tokens":442,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":229},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}